    "# 6. Export for the model server (Tuesday)\n",
    "\n",
    "The server needs:\n",
    "\n",
    "| File | Where | What |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| `material_ae.onnx` | `models/` and `model_app/` | image → **(reconstruction, code)** in one call |\n",
    "| `config.json` | `models/` and `model_app/` | preprocessing, sizes, classes, threshold, results |\n",
    "| `gallery_latents.npy` | `models/` | codes of the gallery patches (what we search in) |\n",
    "| `gallery_meta.json` | `models/` | id and material of each gallery patch |\n",
    "| `gallery_thumbs/*.jpg` | `models/` | the 64 px thumbnails the app shows |\n",
    "| `examples/*.jpg` | `model_app/` | a few test photos for the server page |\n",
    "\n",
    "`models/` goes to Hugging Face. `*.onnx` and `*.npy` are git-ignored, so the Render server **downloads them from Hugging Face** at startup."
   ]
  },
